source.quote:
When MOC-MAB is run, we have for any $i \in \{1,2\}$
\begin{align}
\Pr( \text{Reg}^i (t) < \epsilon_{i}(t) ~ \forall t \in \{ 1,\ldots, T\}  ) \geq 1- 1/T ~\notag
\end{align}
where
\begin{align}
\epsilon_{1}(t) = m^d |{\cal A}|C^1_{\max} + 2 B_{m,T} \sqrt{ |{\cal A}|  m^d t  } + 2 (\beta + 2) v t \notag
\end{align}
and
\begin{align}
\epsilon_{2}(t) =& m^d |{\cal A}|C^2_{\max} + m^d C^2_{\max} |{\cal A}| \left( \frac{2 A_{m,T}} {\beta^2 v^2}  \right)  \notag \\
&+ 2 B_{m,T} \sqrt{ |{\cal A}|  m^d t  } + 2 v t. \notag
\end{align}
